00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:56.940
I feel like there's a lot of like not point and click adventure games, but like text based text based adventure games that probably play around with that.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:04.500
Right. Or the twist of like you being someone more important than than you realize, you know, like when you when you start this game.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.280
Darth Revan. Right.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:13.100
When you start this game, it doesn't become inherently obvious that you are like you don't know who you are.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:17.340
You know, again, you're just waking up in this bathroom stall and you're just kind of wandering around.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:21.180
