00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:34.180
I think it's just a very I mean, yeah, maybe it's a little overdone, but it's incredibly useful.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:45.740
useful for having the world explained to you in a way that like, yeah, generally characters that live in a world don't need the world explained to them.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:47.820
