00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:32.900
And like any good investigator, whether you know it or not at the start of the game, the screen is very similar to Shadowgate in that you have your, you know, your commands or your verbs on the bottom of the screen.

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:37.960
