00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.320
And that's on the right hand side of the screen.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:54.640
And then on the left hand side is this very small but detailed interactive window of, you know, from your POV, what you're seeing in the scene.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:06:03.280
And you can click on things and you kind of the gameplay loop is you verb into the object.

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:08.140
And then the game tells you what's very dirty phrasing.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.400
You verb into the noun.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:19.140
Right. So, you know, you might search something, you might examine something, you might open something, take something.

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:30.480
But this idea of just essentially using that to kind of make the what would have worked as a text adventure game, but now with a visual component to it.

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:39.980
Yeah. And I'm trying to remember if these because there are some shortcuts in this that make that because what describing like that makes it sound more tedious than it is.

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:42.300
